2s/24s: AIA data with a 12-second cadence for EUV wavelengths and a 24-second cadence for UV wavelengths, covering only the flare period.\n\n94A/131A/171A/193A/211A/304/335A:Extreme Ultraviolet (EUV) wavelengths in units of Ångström.\n\n1600A/1700A:Ultraviolet (EUV) wavelengths in units of Ångström.\n\nMagnetogram:Line-of-sight (LOS) magnetogram.\n\nBz/Bt:Vertical (z-component) and transverse (x- and y-component) magnetic fields.\n\ncontinuum: Pseudo-continuum intensity.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16790538","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":0,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":1,"citationsOverTime":[{"year":"2026","total":1}],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2025-08-11T23:32:00.000Z","registered":"2025-08-11T23:32:01.000Z","published":"2025","updated":"2025-08-11T23:32:01.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.16790538","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[{"id":"10.1038/s41597-026-06607-7","type":"dois"}]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.16790537","type":"dois"}]}}}}